        "NSCameraUsageDescription": "Xpass uses the camera to scan QR codes at partner gyms when you check in. For example, you will point the camera at the gym check-in QR code so we can confirm your active subscription and record your visit.",
        "NSMicrophoneUsageDescription": "Xpass uses the microphone only when you record video with the in-app camera, so your clip can include sound (for example, a short video at the gym).",
        "NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription": "Xpass uses your photo library only when you choose a photo—for example, to set your profile picture or to pick an image to upload. We only use the photo you select; we do not browse your library.",
        "NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription": "Allow $(PRODUCT_NAME) to access your location to show nearby gyms",
        "NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription": "Allow $(PRODUCT_NAME) to access your location for map features",
        "ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption": false,
        "NSAppTransportSecurity": {
          "NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsInWebContent": true
